# Captures, and anything cut from them, never enter this repo (CLAUDE.md, "What never goes in this repo").
# A build stage that needs an image of the app's own (an icon, say) adds a narrow exception for that one folder.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.jxr
*.webp
*.bmp
*.gif
*.tif
*.tiff
*.avif
*.heic
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi

# Raw text read from a capture can hold other players' names.
*.ocr.json
*.ocr.txt

# Throwaway work: trial environments, proof pages, extracted frames.
.scratch/
.venv/
__pycache__/

# Claude Code's per-machine settings, and a maintainer's own instructions and tools (docs/build.md, "Local-only files").
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
private/

# Build output.
bin/
obj/
publish/
Releases/
TestResults/
*.user
